# Committed on purpose: both are NEXT_PUBLIC_ values that ship in the client
# bundle regardless, and the anon key only works within what RLS allows — see
# supabase/migrations/0015_rls.sql and friends. Cloudflare Workers Builds runs
# `next build` with no other env source configured, so without this file
# every request crashes creating the Supabase client (undefined URL) — that
# was the cause of the 500 you saw.
